WEBVTT

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:08.751
Baby, carry on

00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:13.756
When the winds of tomorrow howl

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:19.762
Keep on laughing, be the cocky
person that you are

00:00:19.786 --> 00:00:22.949
No matter what happens

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:34.366
Storming through life, during
the day you feel invincible

00:00:36.169 --> 00:00:42.006
Of course, there are those nights
when everything falls apart

00:00:42.976 --> 00:00:48.938
You find yourself humming
an old melody

00:00:50.016 --> 00:00:56.132
Through the pain you feel as sweat
stings your wounded knee

00:00:56.156 --> 00:00:58.167
Baby, carry on

00:00:58.191 --> 00:01:02.594
Even on those mornings when
the wind blows in your face

00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:09.311
Keep on laughing, and even the moon
shall one day look upon you

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.313
Someday your journey will come

00:01:11.337 --> 00:01:16.519
| can at least make one miracle happen

00:01:16.543 --> 00:01:19.255
Until that day

00:01:19.279 --> 00:01:25.241
Don't you surrender! Angel Blue!

00:02:03.756 --> 00:02:05.724
This will be a bad morning.

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:20.182
So you're saying Mistress Celcia
is still with them?

00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:24.165
Yes, they are currently searching
for the third fragment.

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:26.322
Three more to go.

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:30.526
However, the anger of the elves
victimized by that gang

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:32.018
is becoming unmanageable.

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:33.953
Yes, I know.

00:02:41.094 --> 00:02:43.028
What's the matter, Mistress Annette?

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:45.541
How long has that been there?

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:46.809
What?

00:02:46.833 --> 00:02:47.042
Why do you ask?
What?

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:48.310
Why do you ask?

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:50.302
That has been there since
before you were born.

00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:57.009
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:02:57.510 --> 00:03:00.172
Of course, it's been there forever.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:04.426
Yes, it's been there as long
as I can remember.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.963
You know what? I can't remember
what it's called.

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:10.833
You mean you can't remember
that it's called a...

00:03:10.857 --> 00:03:11.800
Called a what?

00:03:11.824 --> 00:03:12.334
| must be senile. What is it called?
Called a what?

00:03:12.358 --> 00:03:14.986
| must be senile. What is it called?

00:03:15.862 --> 00:03:17.728
I think it's called a...

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:20.209
Why can't I remember?

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:23.179
| feel like I've fallen under an evil spell.

00:03:23.203 --> 00:03:24.671
An evil spell?

00:03:36.683 --> 00:03:38.127
How dare you?!

00:03:38.151 --> 00:03:42.731
This is the private garden of
Mistress Celcia Marikreel!

00:03:42.755 --> 00:03:44.223
Kneel down!

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.929
What uniform is that?

00:03:50.663 --> 00:03:52.825
| am Chief Inspector Gild of the
Royal Bureau of Investigation.

00:03:53.433 --> 00:03:55.492
This warrant has been
issued by my office.

00:03:56.236 --> 00:03:59.365
Celcia Marikreel has been stripped
of her honored position today.

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:02.902
This shrine is now property
of the Bureau.

00:04:03.676 --> 00:04:07.723
Mistress Annette, Bishop Ahab,
Bishop Beenal,

00:04:07.747 --> 00:04:10.893
you are under house arrest pursuant to
a full investigation. That is all.

00:04:10.917 --> 00:04:13.996
Wait! How can you justify these actions?

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:15.197
Explain yourself!

00:04:15.221 --> 00:04:15.497
Mistress Celcia has been charged with the
crime of high treason. Explain yourself!

00:04:15.521 --> 00:04:17.489
Mistress Celcia has been charged
with the crime of high treason.

00:04:19.225 --> 00:04:20.693
Treason?!

00:04:44.083 --> 00:04:47.496
This color. This smell.
This consistency.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:49.488
This must be some sort of dream.

00:04:51.557 --> 00:04:53.269
No, it's not a dream.

00:04:53.293 --> 00:04:55.371
How does hitting me prove that?

00:04:55.395 --> 00:04:57.329
There's no way it will taste right.

00:04:57.697 --> 00:05:00.667
Here I go!

00:05:06.873 --> 00:05:11.520
This is... It's curry! It's curry, all right!

00:05:11.544 --> 00:05:14.490
It's the real thing! This is such
a pleasure to digest!

00:05:14.514 --> 00:05:15.982
What are you talking about?

00:05:19.585 --> 00:05:21.053
It looks like the time has come.

00:05:21.421 --> 00:05:23.116
What's wrong, Ms. Airi?

00:05:24.524 --> 00:05:25.992
Oh nothing, really.

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.905
Oh, I needed that!

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:31.407
Finished already?

00:05:31.431 --> 00:05:34.492
Your brain doesn't get enough nutrition
when you eat so quickly.

00:05:35.168 --> 00:05:38.314
A man from Tokyo is used to eating
fast and dumping fast.

00:05:38.338 --> 00:05:39.615
That's so gross!

00:05:39.639 --> 00:05:39.815
Waitress! More water, please!
That's so gross!

00:05:39.839 --> 00:05:42.604
Waitress! More water, please!

00:05:43.109 --> 00:05:46.789
Coming right up!

00:05:46.813 --> 00:05:48.281
Here you go.

00:05:51.050 --> 00:05:52.518
A spell fragment!

00:05:54.587 --> 00:05:57.299
If you come with me peacefully,
| promise this won't take long.

00:05:57.323 --> 00:05:58.791
Are you trying to ask me out?

00:06:00.927 --> 00:06:02.037
Junpei!

00:06:02.061 --> 00:06:02.404
Hey, you haven't paid your check!
Junpei!

00:06:02.428 --> 00:06:03.725
Hey, you haven't paid your check!

00:06:04.597 --> 00:06:06.759
We have more important
things to do right now!

00:06:09.469 --> 00:06:11.665
It's another spell fragment!

00:06:12.338 --> 00:06:13.782
What are you talking about?

00:06:13.806 --> 00:06:15.017
This must be our lucky day.

00:06:15.041 --> 00:06:15.284
