This must be our lucky day.

00:06:15.308 --> 00:06:17.286
This is too good to be true.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.074
We'll find out soon enough.

00:06:22.715 --> 00:06:24.649
Can I warm up your coffee for you?

00:06:25.318 --> 00:06:26.786
Yes, thank you.

00:06:29.389 --> 00:06:31.050
