00:06:37.029 --> 00:06:42.144
All right then, I will begin the transfer
ritual for the third and fourth fragments.

00:06:42.168 --> 00:06:43.636
Make yourselves comfortable.

00:06:44.003 --> 00:06:47.166
Come, lonely travelers, cast
yourselves upon my body.

00:07:00.953 --> 00:07:02.030
How do I look?

00:07:02.054 --> 00:07:02.431
Well...
How do I look?

00:07:02.455 --> 00:07:03.499
Well...

00:07:03.523 --> 00:07:04.400
Well... ...it sure looks...

00:07:04.424 --> 00:07:05.634
