stop looking at me!

00:07:43.496 --> 00:07:46.363
Ms. Celcia, there's only one
more fragment to go.

00:07:48.801 --> 00:07:50.565
Yes, that's correct,

00:07:51.137 --> 00:07:53.282
but why are you looking away?

00:07:53.306 --> 00:07:56.765
It's the least I can do for you,
Ms. Celcia.

00:07:57.276 --> 00:08:00.155
Oh, Ms. Airi, that's so sweet.

00:08:00.179 --> 00:08:03.638
You are the only one who
understands my plight.

00:08:10.623 --> 00:08:15.493
But how did we manage to happen
upon two fragments in one day?

00:08:27.540 --> 00:08:29.008
Oh, Mistress Celcia.

00:08:34.947 --> 00:08:36.415
What is that?

00:08:40.253 --> 00:08:42.415
