to your fallen friend.

00:08:55.601 --> 00:08:57.145
Don't make things any
harder for yourself.

00:08:57.169 --> 00:08:58.547
Helping her will only put you
in greater jeopardy.

00:08:58.571 --> 00:08:58.647
But why are you after Mistress Celcia? Helping
her will only put you in greater jeopardy.

00:08:58.671 --> 00:09:01.231
But why are you after Mistress Celcia?

00:09:02.208 --> 00:09:03.819
We could not ignore the
wailing of their victims.

00:09:03.843 --> 00:09:07.006
Every day brings more complaints about
the three thugs from another world.

00:09:07.380 --> 00:09:09.858
| cannot fathom why our beloved elder,
Mistress Marikreel,

00:09:09.882 --> 00:09:12.249
would give aid and comfort
to the enemy.

00:09:12.752 --> 00:09:14.329
That's not true!

00:09:14.353 --> 00:09:18.000
