them back where they belong!

00:09:18.024 --> 00:09:22.655
Yes, but why go to such
lengths to help them?

00:09:23.296 --> 00:09:24.540
Well...

00:09:24.564 --> 00:09:24.773
It doesn't matter. Celcia Marikreel is
drawing ever closer to our trap. Well...

00:09:24.797 --> 00:09:29.826
It doesn't matter. Celcia Marikreel is
drawing ever closer to our trap.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.448
Something is bothering me.

00:09:33.472 --> 00:09:36.567
Weren't those fragments a
