00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.048
Where did they go?

00:09:44.951 --> 00:09:46.749
Looking for someone?

00:09:52.658 --> 00:09:54.369
Hello!

00:09:54.393 --> 00:09:56.259
Celcia Marikreel, I presume.

00:09:57.229 --> 00:09:58.856
You! The Judge!

00:10:00.766 --> 00:10:01.977
What'll it be?

00:10:02.001 --> 00:10:02.244
Nothing, thanks.
What'll it be?

00:10:02.268 --> 00:10:03.145
Nothing, thanks.

00:10:03.169 --> 00:10:03.478
Nothing, thanks. Order something.
My expense account will cover it.

00:10:03.502 --> 00:10:06.481
Order something. My expense
account will cover it.

00:10:06.505 --> 00:10:07.683
I'm fine.

00:10:07.707 --> 00:10:07.983
I'll have a fresh cup of coffee, please.
I'm fine.

00:10:08.007 --> 00:10:09.685
I'll have a fresh cup of coffee, please.

00:10:09.709 --> 00:10:11.086
Right away, Sir.

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:11.186
So, this was a trap.
