00:10:21.220 --> 00:10:23.999
Then my activities are well known.

00:10:24.023 --> 00:10:28.203
Yes, everyone knows you have aided
the three from the other world.

00:10:28.227 --> 00:10:30.439
So, you have come to haul us away.

00:10:30.463 --> 00:10:32.207
Hopefully, without having to
resort to violent measures.

00:10:32.231 --> 00:10:35.667
Celcia Marikreel, if you cooperate,
your charges will be reduced.

00:10:36.035 --> 00:10:37.746
What about the others?

00:10:37.770 --> 00:10:39.738
Life imprisonment if they're lucky.

00:10:42.308 --> 00:10:44.052
It's out of your hands.

00:10:44.076 --> 00:10:47.808
They are unwanted guests in our world.

00:10:50.449 --> 00:10:53.510
All right then, I'll bring them to you,

00:10:53.919 --> 00:10:55.597
but I'll need some time.

00:10:55.621 --> 00:10:58.283
Understood. I'll be here
this time tomorrow.

00:10:59.492 --> 00:11:02.154
I'm counting on you, Mistress
Celcia Marikreel,

00:11:03.295 --> 00:11:06.274
and the citizens of our world
are counting on you

00:11:06.298 --> 00:11:09.268
to recognize your duty as
our honored elder.

00:11:13.305 --> 00:11:14.773
I'll be waiting.

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:24.292
It's like we're back in Japan.

00:11:24.316 --> 00:11:28.263
No kidding. "Lots O' Vegetables:
