00:12:20.906 --> 00:12:23.238
Don't! That thing will steal my soul!

00:12:23.676 --> 00:12:25.644
You don't even know what it is, do you?

00:12:26.679 --> 00:12:29.740
No, I thought I knew what it was.

00:12:31.183 --> 00:12:32.994
Calm down. It's just a camera.

00:12:33.018 --> 00:12:36.898
Stop it! That thing is going
to steal my soul!

00:12:36.922 --> 00:12:39.568
Even a dog would know
what a camera is.

00:12:39.592 --> 00:12:41.770
What century are you from, anyway?

00:12:41.794 --> 00:12:43.660
Okay! Hold it like that!

00:12:49.568 --> 00:12:51.546
Wow! This is amazing!

00:12:51.570 --> 00:12:54.149
Photography doesn't exist
in your world, does it?

00:12:54.173 --> 00:12:58.186
| sure wish you had taken this when
| was in my natural state.

00:12:58.210 --> 00:13:01.180
Really? To us, this is your natural state.

00:13:01.580 --> 00:13:03.548
Well, I'll have to disagree!

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:07.863
Your world sure is full of
interesting things.

00:13:07.887 --> 00:13:09.564
They are just the achievements
of science.

00:13:09.588 --> 00:13:11.352
Achievements of science?

00:13:11.991 --> 00:13:13.535
Can I keep this?

00:13:13.559 --> 00:13:17.939
Sure. Hey, I know! I'll get a
photo of me with Mike!

00:13:17.963 --> 00:13:19.431
Don't waste the film, okay?

00:13:19.832 --> 00:13:22.995
We should save it for when we get
all the spell fragments together.

00:13:23.803 --> 00:13:25.680
Just one more to go.

00:13:25.704 --> 00:13:29.265
