go back to her original form.

00:13:31.544 --> 00:13:33.012
Yes...

00:13:34.146 --> 00:13:38.014
That's right. One more fragment will
make the spell complete!

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:40.714
Yes! Just one more to go!

00:13:44.723 --> 00:13:48.870
Why do we have to move on
at this time of night?

00:13:48.894 --> 00:13:52.296
