00:15:46.845 --> 00:15:49.644
Oh, my goodness! What can be done
to prevent this from happening?

00:15:50.049 --> 00:15:52.609
Well, if you can return us to Japan...

00:16:03.395 --> 00:16:06.660
Idiot! What the hell are you doing
in the middle of the road?!

00:16:07.833 --> 00:16:10.211
Celcia, what is the meaning of this?

00:16:10.235 --> 00:16:12.397
Have you actually chosen
to side with them?

00:16:13.339 --> 00:16:15.016
| had hoped that your sense
of honor and duty

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:16.508
