you felt for them.

00:16:16.875 --> 00:16:18.843
| must admit that I am disappointed.

00:16:19.311 --> 00:16:20.989
Who the hell are you?

00:16:21.013 --> 00:16:22.657
Greetings to you, Sir.

00:16:22.681 --> 00:16:25.946
| am the Chief Judge of the Royal
Bureau of Investigation.

00:16:26.618 --> 00:16:28.596
You three marauders are under arrest,

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:31.487
as is the traitor, Mistress
Celcia Marikreel.

00:16:31.924 --> 00:16:33.368
