don't find it in time!

00:16:43.635 --> 00:16:46.104
Shouting utter nonsense
will do you no good.

00:16:46.905 --> 00:16:50.752
If you had cooperated with me, you
could have saved yourself.

00:16:50.776 --> 00:16:52.387
Ms. Celcial

00:16:52.411 --> 00:16:54.072
You were trying to protect us.

00:16:54.613 --> 00:16:56.424
Screw you, pall

00:16:56.448 --> 00:16:59.179
If we find the fragment,
we can go home!

00:16:59.551 --> 00:17:02.664
Quiet! You have victimized my people,

00:17:02.688 --> 00:17:04.833
so why should I grant you any favors?

00:17:04.857 --> 00:17:07.326
Idiot! We didn't come here
because we wanted to!

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:09.838
You are resisting arrest.

00:17:09.862 --> 00:17:12.024
Therefore, I will have to
take you by force.

00:17:12.498 --> 00:17:14.330
That will be interesting.

00:17:14.733 --> 00:17:16.895
Just try to take us on!

00:17:17.503 --> 00:17:19.047
I shall.

00:17:19.071 --> 00:17:21.233
Arise, Mirage Golem!

00:17:27.413 --> 00:17:28.881
Oh, my!

00:17:31.417 --> 00:17:33.078
They look just like us.

00:17:33.585 --> 00:17:36.350
If you're willing to call upon Mirage
Golems, you mean business.

00:17:37.423 --> 00:17:39.734
Cheap copies are no match
for the real thing!

00:17:39.758 --> 00:17:41.419
Enough small talk.

00:17:41.860 --> 00:17:43.487
Mirage Golems, attack!

00:17:52.304 --> 00:17:55.672
Damn! He's countering with
my exact moves!

00:17:58.343 --> 00:18:00.989
The Mirage Golems copy the inner
workings of a subject

00:18:01.013 --> 00:18:02.991
just as easily as they copy
the outside form.

00:18:03.015 --> 00:18:04.483
No way!

00:18:14.359 --> 00:18:17.192
She's matching me move for move,
even the ones only I know!

00:18:21.533 --> 00:18:23.001
Another me.

00:18:23.969 --> 00:18:25.680
My looks.

00:18:25.704 --> 00:18:27.172
My agility.

00:18:27.739 --> 00:18:29.217
My talents.

00:18:29.241 --> 00:18:31.107
All perfectly mirrored?

00:18:32.744 --> 00:18:34.222
Mystic defense!

00:18:34.246 --> 00:18:35.714
Mystic defense!

00:18:37.749 --> 00:18:39.627
Bring it on, baby!

00:18:39.651 --> 00:18:41.119
Bring it on, baby!

00:18:41.520 --> 00:18:42.697
Give me your best stuff!

00:18:42.721 --> 00:18:44.132
Give me your best stuff!

00:18:44.156 --> 00:18:45.366
Stop copying me!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:46.768
Stop copying me!

00:18:46.792 --> 00:18:48.603
Jeez, you're starting to tick me off!

00:18:48.627 --> 00:18:50.338
Jeez, you're starting to tick me off!

00:18:50.362 --> 00:18:51.973
'I put an end to you!

00:18:51.997 --> 00:18:53.465
'I put an end to you!

00:18:54.066 --> 00:18:55.534
Summation Spell Attack!

00:18:56.368 --> 00:18:57.836
Summation Spell Attack!

00:19:05.377 --> 00:19:07.436
| don't know how to defeat myself.

00:19:20.692 --> 00:19:22.717
You can stay here and witness
their defeat.

00:19:23.095 --> 00:19:24.927
It won't take very long.

00:19:31.670 --> 00:19:34.037
This is pointless! She matches
me in every way!

00:19:34.740 --> 00:19:36.504
| can't even run away from her!

00:19:39.178 --> 00:19:40.646
| don't want to move.

00:19:41.513 --> 00:19:45.593
How can I surpass an opponent who
is exactly as skilled as I am?

00:19:45.617 --> 00:19:47.085
How can I win?

00:19:54.393 --> 00:19:56.555
Damn! I knew he'd do that!

00:19:58.330 --> 00:19:59.991
What is that stupid dog doing now?

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.268
| give up.

00:20:06.405 --> 00:20:07.873
Beat it!

00:20:11.843 --> 00:20:13.311
I'm exhausted.

00:20:41.106 --> 00:20:42.870
You stupid mutt.

00:20:44.042 --> 00:20:45.476
Junpei...

00:20:53.952 --> 00:20:55.420
Junpei!

00:20:57.656 --> 00:20:59.920
So, what now? Shall we continue?

00:21:10.469 --> 00:21:12.213
| surrender.

00:21:12.237 --> 00:21:13.705
Please, stop this.

00:21:25.784 --> 00:21:28.151
You can't, Ms. Celcia...

00:21:28.820 --> 00:21:32.800
Celcia Marikreel and Those
Who Hunt Elves!

00:21:32.824 --> 00:21:34.656
You're under arrest!

00:21:54.379 --> 00:22:01.462
It's okay to take a break on a day
when you feel despondent

00:22:01.486 --> 00:22:08.085
Life is long and fickle, you know

00:22:08.460 --> 00:22:15.576
| can make you a hundred
times stronger

00:22:15.600 --> 00:22:18.813
Come on, let's sleep for now

00:22:18.837 --> 00:22:22.296
Hold me gently

00:22:22.741 --> 00:22:27.702
Even if you met a dinosaur

00:22:29.848 --> 00:22:36.531
You are the kind of person that
would just laugh it off

00:22:36.555 --> 00:22:43.237
Winning through flower gardens
and storm ravaged plains

00:22:43.261 --> 00:22:50.878
| can hear how the times are
changing around us

00:22:50.902 --> 00:22:57.552
Distinguishing both the
sour and the sweet

00:22:57.576 --> 00:23:05.576
Just don't give up, because the genius
always comes at the end

00:23:12.758 --> 00:23:15.318
Art is an explosion!

00:23:16.228 --> 00:23:18.390
The Earth is blue!

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:21.356
Men are ambitious,

00:23:21.933 --> 00:23:24.402
but only Man can construe!

00:23:25.003 --> 00:23:27.882
Life is a stage, and you are
the central player!

00:23:27.906 --> 00:23:32.070
Did you enjoy "Those Who Hunt Elves?"

00:23:32.511 --> 00:23:34.622
Too bad the next episode
is the final one!

00:23:34.646 --> 00:23:36.324
"Those Who Still Hunt Elves"

00:23:36.348 --> 00:23:37.816
You won't want to miss it!
